        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia BTB-9027P, Back-To-Back Bar Door Pull Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Bar Back-to-Back Pull Set comes packaged as a pair of 2 pulls with back to back hardware. These Industrial Chic Door Pulls are available in some of the hottest finish colors of the season. Choose from 12 inch or 18 inch center to center door pull lengths. The Back-To-Back Bar Door Pull Set will add modern flair to any front door be it residential or commercial. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Packaged with 2 pulls</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia Industrial Chic Bar Pull Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back-to-Back mounting</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>BTB-9027P/305:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>BTB-9027P/457:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia BTB-9027P Pull is available as a <a href=\"/products/ultima-ii-bar-door-handle-omnia-9027p\"><b>Thru-Bolt Mounted Single Pull</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-C08PC3_size.gif?v=1704354638\" width=\"600\" height=\"144\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>",
